=== Vials
<vials>
#figure(image("../resources/img/test tubes.png", width: 5.5cm),
  caption: [
    Vials of spinal fluid extracted for experimentation
  ]
)
<vials>

These vials can be found in the fridge in the laboratory, four of them
have their name and room number attached. When they are taken out and
not put in a cooler they are starting to develop black flakes like ash
or grime, while at the same time fingers or toes go numb and start to
blacken with necrosis. If they are not put back into cold storage in
time characters will incur that can be stabilised by putting the vials
in a cold place for a while.

When one of these vials is destroyed the PC named on the vial just dies
instantaneously, which allows their spirit to leave the body. This will
cost them for the traumatic experience of dying. The PC’s spirit can now
try to find a new body in one of the
#link(<other_patient_rooms>)[other patient rooms];~(p.~).

